# Obsidian UI session state — pane layout and graph zoom, rewritten every time the
# vault is opened. Tracked, these re-dirty the working tree constantly, and a dirty
# tree is a stopping state for the unattended loop (`ost-agent loop start`, D5): the
# hourly firing would refuse forever over a changed graph zoom level.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/graph.json
